From ec2fa0ad1d2a4515eecda26896a58096762b5b71 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: tonyfan <waterwet@outlook.com>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 15:05:02 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] fix: adapt QTI audio core to Android 17 APIs

Handle mmap descriptors, unsupported flush-from-frame requests, ACN
channel counts and range-loop warnings. Source build validation does
not establish this HAL as the runtime provider; RoadSTR uses stock HALs.

Change-Id: Iffdab29ce12699199f545debae526822bcb621cb
---
